        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> @echasnovski this does not happen when I disable scrolling animation with :lua MiniAnimate.config.scroll.enable = false.\r\n> \r\n> is there a way to disable it temporarily when pasting?\r\n\r\nThere seems to be `vim.paste()` function almost just for this purpose. Try putting this code in your config:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal original_paste = vim.paste\r\nvim.paste = function(...)\r\n  local cache_enable_scroll = MiniAnimate.config.scroll.enable\r\n  MiniAnimate.config.scroll.enable = false\r\n\r\n  pcall(original_paste, ...)\r\n\r\n  MiniAnimate.config.scroll.enable = cache_enable_scroll\r\nend\r\n```",
            "created_at": "2023-03-20T11:57:47Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/275#issuecomment-1476093091",
